<title>USA: Ampal-American Israel names officers.</title>
<headline>Ampal-American Israel names officers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ampal-American Israel Corp said Wednesday that Yehoshua Gleitman was elected to the newly created position of chief executive.</p>
<p>Gleitman became chief executive of Ampal's Israeli subsidiaries in April 1997.</p>
<p>And the company said Daniel Steinmetz was elected chairman of the board, filling a vacancy that existed since December 1996.</p>
<p>Steinmetz is an officer of Rebar Financial Corp, which owns about 38 percent of the Class A stock of Ampal, according to a statement issued by the company.</p>
</text>
